        "id": 1,
        "headline": "Why does a chatbot lose the thread?",
        "body": "Two ideas explain how text reaches a model.",
        "narration": "Welcome to VisualForge AI. Tokens are the pieces a language model processes, and the context window limits the information available for a response. Together, these ideas explain why a long conversation can lose important details. Let us follow the text from your question to the answer.",
